NeatShift {0}
A modern file organization tool with symbolic link support.
Features: • Move files and folders while keeping them accessible • Create and manage symbolic links • System restore point creation • Modern Windows 11 style interface
⚠️ Important Notice: NeatShift is currently in testing phase. While we implement safety measures, please: • Create manual backups or system restore points • Verify symbolic links after moving files • Report any issues through Discord or Telegram
The software is provided 'as is', without warranty of any kind.
